          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "Layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(74, 31, 122);\u0022\u003EAdvancement Via Individual Determination\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAVID is an award-winning, national program designed to help students \u0026ldquo;in the middle\u0026rdquo; succeed and enter four-year colleges and universities directly out of high school. \u0026ldquo;B,\u0026rdquo; \u0026ldquo;C,\u0026rdquo; and even sometimes \u0026ldquo;D\u0026rdquo; students are placed in a rigorous, college-prep curriculum, and are also constantly tutored by their peers and by specially trained college students. Students and their families are guided through the college application, scholarship, and financial aid processes.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETo learn more about AVID, visit the \u003Ca href=\u0022http://www.avidonline.org/\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022 rel=\u0022noopener\u0022\u003Eofficial AVID website\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a9d1ce00-0000-4b0e-9c22-a9d1ce000001",
